["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | Rational Reminder 426 tight wad spendthrift unconflicted consumer financial infidelity prenup\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-结婚前先做花钱测试-紧手和挥霍者互相吸引-也更容易离婚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad3115003cac32ae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>结婚前先做花钱测试：紧手和挥霍者互相吸引，也更容易离婚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究把花钱的人分成紧手和挥霍者，两端的人更容易互相吸引，但婚后金钱冲突更多、婚姻满意度更低；婚礼花得越多，离婚风险反而越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人财务</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Predatory Industry Behind MLB’s Dominican Superstar Pipeline early agreement international draft signing bonus Dominican Summer League\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-papertrail-mlb-在多米尼加建了棒球城堡-也养出了放贷人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed1b4a79f40f86fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>MLB 在多米尼加建了棒球城堡，也养出了放贷人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MLB 每年在多米尼加投入高达 4 亿美元，却没有选秀、允许 16 岁前私下签约，于是催生了一个向球员家庭放高利贷的影子产业，而 David Ortiz 被指是其中一环。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育产业</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Where Have The Insects Gone?? With Dr. Jessica Ware colony collapse disorder Varroa mite neonicotinoid pollinator garden oothika spiracles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-sciencevs-昆虫正在消失-但杀虫剂不是最大凶手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/632ea71d96602758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>昆虫正在消失，但杀虫剂不是最大凶手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">昆虫数量下降被反复质疑夸大，但全球数据仍在指向同一方向；真正被低估的凶手不是农业，而是普通人随手买来用的杀虫剂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生态</span><span class=\"tag\">昆虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E909.我们给残障人写「爽文」戏剧，把健全人写成弱势群体 原罪人 镜面人 口述影像\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cn907a40-残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数-不是要你同情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b8c6d4c5deab1aa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数，不是要你同情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">妖妖把社会关系整个调转过来：核战后多数人成了改造人，少数没改造的健全人成了原罪人，要争取权利的反倒是他们。这不是诉苦，是给残障人写的爽文。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残障</span><span class=\"tag\">戏剧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: Genes &amp; the Inheritance of Memories Across Generations | Dr. Oded Rechavi Weismann barrier C. elegans small RNAs RNA interference epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-huberman-获得性遗传在线虫已被证实-人类还没有证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8f8083a6d5296169-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>获得性遗传在线虫已被证实，人类还没有证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">教科书用魏斯曼屏障解释为什么练出的肌肉传不下去；但在线虫里，敲掉后代自己造小 RNA 的能力，它们仍能抵抗父母遇过的病毒，只改大脑里的 RNA 就能改变三代后的行为。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表观遗传</span><span class=\"tag\">线虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Organized Retail Crime at Big Box Stores shrink ORC (organized retail crime) boosters fence INFORM Act edge analytics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-oddlots-偷来的货能卖到原价七八折-零售盗窃已经产业化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>偷来的货能卖到原价七八折，零售盗窃已经产业化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被盗商品要经过两层手：boosters 被招募进店偷货，fence 负责清洗标识和转售，之后挂上二手平台。联网的赃物能卖到原价七八折，T 恤和除臭剂只剩三成多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售损耗</span><span class=\"tag\">有组织零售犯罪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How baseball got its beat walk-up song seventh inning stretch Tin Pan Alley closer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-throughline-棒球场的音乐不是伴奏-是球迷抢回比赛的方式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f35a52e32ee13fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>棒球场的音乐不是伴奏，是球迷抢回比赛的方式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">棒球官方史学家嫌球场音乐太吵，但正是球迷齐唱 Hey Hey Goodbye 把客队投手唱到手软——音乐让观众从看客变成比赛的一部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">棒球</span><span class=\"tag\">现场体验</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Iron Age Ireland sacral kingship Fianna currach opidum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-ancients-爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵-只有贸易和语言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef50c48b77dede87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵，只有贸易和语言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统说法认为凯尔特人带着铁器在公元前500年入侵爱尔兰，但考古几乎找不到外来移民的痕迹——凯尔特身份其实是青铜时代晚期海上贸易网络里慢慢长出来的语言共同体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">爱尔兰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of Stamford Bridge Explained berserk chape house carls Varangian Guard Doomsday Book\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-historyhit-斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销-考古刚找到战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc50d2d1c5ba1e0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">31:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销，考古刚找到战场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1066年9月，英王哈罗德四天急行军约200英里，全歼哈拉尔德·哈德拉达的维京大军；但这场足以奠定任何君主声望的胜利，几天后就被黑斯廷斯的惨败彻底抹去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">维京时代</span><span class=\"tag\">1066年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"394. Road To 9/11: Hijackers, CIA Failures, and America’s Darkest Day (Part 6) cock-up view of history muscle hijackers casing videotape the wall ghazia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-empirehist-cia-提前数月警告-白宫为何还是没拦住-9-11/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>CIA 提前数月警告，白宫为何还是没拦住 9/11</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情报系统把战略预警做到了极致，但决策者可以选择无视——这是 9/11 前七个月真正的失败点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情报失灵</span><span class=\"tag\">组织决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Considering a Career Change? How About FINFLUENCER? finfluencer RIA Roth IRA cringe phase top of funnel W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-mastersinbiz-做金融网红不是当网红-是把社媒当漏斗顶端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.omnycontent.com/d/clips/e73c998e-6e60-432f-8610-ae210140c5b1/4e4cd910-40a1-4619-a5f3-ae2b0012ffff/620a27ee-8907-4f6b-9009-b4c001681c89/image.jpg?t=1788990750&amp;size=Medium\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>做金融网红不是当网红，是把社媒当漏斗顶端</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tyler Gardner 从教师转行做理财顾问，再转做金融内容，做到 600 万粉丝。他的判断是：短视频只是漏斗顶端，真正的资产是你能自己拥有的邮件列表和长内容。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">金融内容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"5 Solo Founders Called In With Their Hardest Problem | Solo Founders Office Hours RL environment jobs to be done GMV ERP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-solofounders-单人创始人最缺的不是人手-是有人逼你说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f64dfbc7c597bfb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人最缺的不是人手，是有人逼你说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Julian 给五位单人创始人的诊断几乎都指向同一件事：没有联合创始人，你就失去了那个逼你面对「今天到底做了什么」的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ashurbanipal cuneiform colophon Neo-Assyrian Sardanapalus Bisitun inscription\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-stuffmissed-亚述巴尼拔的图书馆-他既是暴君-也是最早的藏书家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>亚述巴尼拔的图书馆：他既是暴君，也是最早的藏书家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亚述巴尼拔一边把敌国国王关进狗窝、逼人用祖先骨头做砖，一边建起人类最早的系统性图书馆，让《吉尔伽美什史诗》活到今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">考古</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Leaders, Luck, and Irreplaceability environmental Kuznets curve natural experiments Dvorak keyboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-tyler-没有不可替代的领袖-只有不可替代的运气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2d90e9a992692a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>没有不可替代的领袖，只有不可替代的运气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德说历史上没有不可替代的领袖，成吉思汗只是恰好生在两千年来最湿润的草原；但 Rachel Carson 和 Resnick 这类人，确实让事情提前了十年二十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">地理决定论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"When will average people feel AI’s impact? Engels’ pause Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-interconnects-ai-对普通人是舍入误差-扩散要五十年-反弹却等不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ea9ccfe0923b7a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">8:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 对普通人是舍入误差：扩散要五十年，反弹却等不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工业革命给普通人便宜衣服和缝纫机，AI 目前只给普通人好玩的图片和更好的搜索——好处太间接，而政治反弹来得太快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 扩散</span><span class=\"tag\">公众认知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Grades the AI Models? | Ben Horowitz &amp; Rayan Krishnan held-out private benchmarks recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking token maxing harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-a16z-公开榜单测不出模型真实能力-第三方评测才是刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>公开榜单测不出模型真实能力，第三方评测才是刚需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Llama 4 在公开榜单上表现惊人，在 Vals 的私有留出集上却是不达标——自报成绩和真实能力之间的裂缝，正在催生一个独立的评测行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI评测</span><span class=\"tag\">基准测试</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Meteorology (WEATHER &amp; CLIMATE) Encore with Marshall Shepherd Clausius-Clapeyron equation wet bulb globe temperature bombogenesis atmospheric river ENSO AMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-ologies-天气预报准确率-95-但没人相信它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>天气预报准确率 95%，但没人相信它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">气象学家说预报三到五天内有 95% 准确率，公众只记住被淋湿的那一次；气候不是未来时，是现在进行时。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气象</span><span class=\"tag\">气候传播</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we built Grok Bot in a month | Roman Ugarte (SpaceXAI) MCP steering infovore unshipping\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-lennys-grok-bot-一个月做出来-小团队躲进山洞-大团队会拖没微决策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42cbfb013ec2988d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>Grok Bot 一个月做出来：小团队躲进山洞，大团队会拖没微决策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把知识工作做进 Cursor 不是显然错误，但用户能闻出三套愿景共用一块屏——那是把组织架构图直接发货。所以 Grok Bot 从零开始，几个人躲进山洞一个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Longwell on How Democrats Can Defeat Trump focus group low-information voters Build Baby, Build\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-goodfight-特朗普的不可复制性-才是民主党真正的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普的不可复制性，才是民主党真正的机会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特朗普的持久力来自几十年电视名人身份，别人学不来；民主党若把特朗普时代的教训当成通用规律，就会在2028年重蹈2024年的覆辙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">选举策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Researchers on the Future of Mathematical Reasoning sphere packing linear programming bound spherical code sofic group Aldous–Lyons conjecture harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-a16z-数学家怕-ai-写出千页证明-结果它只写了-15-页/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>数学家怕 AI 写出千页证明，结果它只写了 15 页</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类反证一个关于随机图的猜想，用了 250 页、还建立在另外 200 页之上；AI 在群论内部十几页就证出了更弱的那个结论。AI 的数学证明普遍短而优雅，长证明反倒只有人类写得出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学推理</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky eating, protein, food dyes, and nutrition myths: What parents actually need to know with Jennifer Anderson ARFID rest and digest hyper palatable food health impact tiers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-secureattach-孩子挑食别怪食物-先修关系-再谈营养/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子挑食别怪食物：先修关系，再谈营养</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喂养策略本身没那么重要，重要的是你怎么执行；父母先照顾好自己的食物关系，才是对孩子最有效的干预。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童营养</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Walter Russell Mead - How America Keeps Winning - [Invest Like the Best, EP.490] Tech Hamiltonian info-structure Jacksonian soft blockade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-ilt-让对手依赖你的体系-是美国赢了三百年的秘密/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aa91f50130802ffe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>让对手依赖你的体系，是美国赢了三百年的秘密</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷兰、英国、美国轮番当老大，靠的不是封锁而是让对手把身家性命押进自己的海洋体系——等它们离不开航路与市场，切断就成了战争之外最有效的杀手锏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">海洋霸权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 221 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 2: A current conversation Catatonia Anti-NMDA receptor encephalitis Succinylcholine Retrograde amnesia Transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-tpwky-ect-不是你想的那样-从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>ECT 不是你想的那样：从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现代 ECT 是在麻醉和肌肉松弛剂下进行的程序，疗效显著，但有关记忆丧失的副作用证据仍不完全清楚，社会对此的误解导致它被过度污名化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">电休克疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"288: How Do I Help My Disorganized Teen? executive functioning time blindness metacognition natural consequences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-asklisa-孩子丢三落四不是懒-是前额叶还没长好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/747ab52ea57af87e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子丢三落四不是懒，是前额叶还没长好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14岁男孩的前额叶要到25岁才发育完，所以丢三落四不是态度问题。真正的问题是：家长自己的执行功能也不够用，却要替孩子搭一套他根本撑不住的系统。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">执行功能</span>\n</div></div></a>"]